  "solution_ref": "$\\sum_{k=1}^7S_k=28a+56d=644$ → $a+2d=23$. $a+6d=13m$ → $d=\\frac{13m-23}4$, $d+9=\\frac{13(m+1)}4$ → $m=3,7,\\dots$; $a=-\\frac{13}2m+\\frac{69}2>0$ → $m<\\frac{69}{13}$, $m=3$, $d=4$, $a=15$. $a_2=19$",
